@startuml
title Prepare-Doc - Training Workflow (High Level)

skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}

|Data Preparation|
start
:Collect 10 purpose-built datasets\n(~503K total: Orientation, Skew,\nResolution, IQA, Script,\nHandwriting, Capture, Shadow,\nWarping, Code);
:Apply augmentation profiles\n(aged/historical, multi-degradation,\ncolor mode diversity);
:Create annotation labels\n(per-task: classification, regression);
:Split train/val/test sets\n(SHA256-keyed global registry);

|Step 1: MobileNetV4 Bootstrap|
:Initialize MobileNetV4-Conv-S\n(~4M params, pretrained);
:Add 3 task heads:\n- Orientation (4-class)\n- Skew regression (±10°)\n- Resolution quality (0-1);
:Train on ground truth labels\n(Modal GPU: A10);
:Validate per-head thresholds\n(orientation > 95%, skew MAE < 0.5°);
if (MobileNetV4 passes\nvalidation?) then (yes)
  :Export MobileNetV4 checkpoint;
else (no)
  :Tune hyperparameters;
  :Retrain;
endif

|Step 2: SigLIP 2 Multi-Task|
:Load SigLIP 2 NAFlex backbone\n(~88M, frozen ViT-B/16);
:Attach 22 task heads\n(5 groups: IQA[6], Script[3],\nOrientation+Skew[3], Handwriting[5],\nPage Attrs[5]);
:Train heads on all 10 datasets\n(weighted multi-task loss);
if (All heads pass\ngraduation thresholds?) then (yes)
  :Export SigLIP 2 checkpoint;
else (no)
  :Adjust loss weights;
  :Retrain;
endif

|Step 3: MobileNetV4 Distillation|
:Generate SigLIP 2 soft labels\n(orientation, skew, resolution);
:Re-train MobileNetV4-Conv-S\nwith KL-divergence (T=3);
if (Improved thresholds?\norientation > 98%?) then (yes)
  :Export to ONNX (3 heads);
  :Export SigLIP 2 to ONNX (22 heads);
else (no)
  :Adjust alpha, temperature;
  :Retrain MobileNetV4;
endif

|Deployment|
:Register models in registry;
:Deploy MobileNetV4 as pre-correction gate (~3ms);
:Deploy SigLIP 2 as multi-task model (~50ms);
:Docling layout models (pre-trained, no training);
stop

note right
  Training infrastructure:
  - Modal serverless GPU (A10)
  - GCS for datasets
  - HuggingFace for SigLIP 2 backbone
  - ~$10 total per training run

  **PLANNED (Deferred)**:
  MobileCLIP-2 distillation cascade
  for edge/mobile deployment
end note

@enduml
